'''Elderwood Scythe''' is an [[Ancient Weapons|ancient]] knife that was originally obtainable by purchasing the 40th tier in the Main Event for 80,000 [[Candies (2019)|Candies]] {{Currency|Candies2019}} during the [[Halloween Event 2019|2019 Halloween Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended. 

==Appearance==
Elderwood Scythe resembles an old-like tree. The handle is bent and frayed like a tree trunk, and the scythe’s blade is purple and black with a couple of purple streaks, resembling a purple leaf. 

==Trivia==
* It was designed by [[IDontHaveAUse]].
* It had a different picture upon release.
*It partners with the [[Godly Weapons|godly]] gun [[Elderwood Revolver]], making the [[Elderwood Set]].
*It is also part of the [https://murder-mystery-2.fandom.com/wiki/Murder_Mystery_2_Wiki:Wiki-Bot/Full_Elderwood_Set Full Elderwood Set] with [[Elderwood Blade]] and [[Elderwood Revolver]].
*It was one of the main victims of [[The Duping Glitch (2021)]], causing it to lose a lot of value.
*It is the first ancient weapon obtainable by purchasing the last tier from an event, the others being [[Logchopper]], [[Hallowscythe]], [[Icebreaker]], [[Harvester]], [[Icepiercer]], [[Traveler's Axe]] and [[Gingerscope]].
* This is one of the few scythes in game, the others being [[Nik's Scythe]], [[Batwing]], [[Icewing]], [[Hallowscythe]], [[Reaver]] and [[Gingerscythe|Gingerscythe.]]
